# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the ses engine gate.
#
# Qt 6.12 is not built with TSan instrumentation. TSan still intercepts the
# pthread primitives Qt uses and reports races inside Qt's own thread-pool and
# QtTest watchdog teardown (condition-variable destroy vs wait, stack memset vs
# wait, and the watchdog thread outliving the test function). Those reports do
# not involve ses code. Suppress only the Qt frames — ses symbols stay checked.
race:QWaitCondition::~QWaitCondition
race:libQt6Test.so*
thread:QThread::start
